                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "You can really tell where the ideas for [url=store.steampowered.com/app/2325290/Sky_Children_of_the_Light/]Sky: Children of the Light[/url] came from.\n\nJourney is a short game about a... well... a [i]journey[/i] through a desert inhabited by cloth creatures. There aren't many movement options other than walking (and jumping/flying at some specific times), but the game is still quite enjoyable, if you like walking sims. It also looks good, and has a nice story.\nBut the main appeal of this game, is that your lonely [i]journey[/i] might not be so lonely after all ;)",
